      "BROWS": 8,
      "EYES": 9,
      "ACCENT": 10,
      "ACCENT2": 11,
      "ACCESSORY": 12
    },
    "regionsNote": "13-15 reserved. ACCESSORY (12) keeps the accessory colour separate from headwear (ACCENT/ACCENT2), so a cap and headphones can differ.",
